//@version=6
// Control for the P5 drawdown liveness probe (card #151): the same entry with NO
// adverse excursion -- every bar's low stays at or above the entry price and the
// trade never loses -- so both drawdown maxima must read exactly 0. A pin that
// only asserted "non-zero" on the liveness probe could pass on an accumulator
// that reports garbage; this control says the accumulator is quiet when it
// should be.
//
//   bars 0-2 flat at 100; L entered on bar 2 (fills bar 3 open at 100)
//   bars 3-5 rise (lows 100, 104, 107): no open loss, no intrabar dip below entry
//   the run ENDS with L open (open P&L +9)
strategy("P5 drawdown control", initial_capital = 100000,
         default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1,
         commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0)

if bar_index == 2
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)

plot(strategy.position_size, "position_size")
plot(strategy.openprofit, "openprofit")
